{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"老子·influence-and-legacy","stage":"DONE","category":"laozi","categoryLabel":"老子","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.7,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/15_laozi/5_influence-and-legacy","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"影响与遗产\">影响与遗产</h1><p>本卷回答一个问题：<strong>老子凭什么持续影响中国与世界两千五百年？</strong> 它不复述老子思想的内容（那属于前置卷），而是追踪这些思想在历史中的实际传播、转化与再阐释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷</h2><ul>\n<li>想了解老子<strong>思想本身</strong>（道法自然、无为而治、守柔）→ 先读 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>。</li>\n<li>想了解《道德经》<strong>文本与核心教义</strong> → 读 <a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a>。</li>\n<li>想了解老子<strong>其人其事与生平争议</strong> → 读 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 与 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>。</li>\n<li>本卷（影响与遗产）则专注于<strong>影响史</strong>：思想落地后发生了什么。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构与推荐路径\">三章结构与推荐路径</h2><p>建议按&quot;由近及远、由具体到永恒&quot;的顺序阅读：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"influence-in-china/\">在中国的影响</a>——道家如何成为中国思想的支柱（儒道互补、黄老之治、玄学、艺术美学），并延伸到道教宗教。</li>\n<li><a href=\"global-influence/\">世界性的影响</a>——《道德经》如何成为继《圣经》之后译本最多的典籍，及其对现代哲学、科学、生态的启发。</li>\n<li><a href=\"enduring-wisdom/\">不朽的智慧</a>——剥离时空背景后，老子留给个体的生活智慧与永恒之&quot;道&quot;。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>前置建议：阅读本卷前最好已掌握&quot;无为&quot;&quot;柔弱胜刚强&quot;&quot;道法自然&quot;三个核心概念，否则可先回到 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a> 卷。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"influence-in-china","title":"在中国的影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/influence-and-legacy/influence-in-china","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-pillar-of-chinese-thought","title":"中国思想的支柱","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/influence-and-legacy/influence-in-china/a-pillar-of-chinese-thought"},{"seq":2,"slug":"daoism-and-religion","title":"道家与道教","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/influence-and-legacy/influence-in-china/daoism-and-religion"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"global-influence","title":"世界性的影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/influence-and-legacy/global-influence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spreading-to-the-world","title":"传播于世界","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/influence-and-legacy/global-influence/spreading-to-the-world"},{"seq":2,"slug":"influence-on-modern-thought","title":"对现代思想的影响","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/influence-and-legacy/global-influence/influence-on-modern-thought"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-wisdom","title":"不朽的智慧","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/influence-and-legacy/enduring-wisdom","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wisdom-for-living","title":"生活的智慧","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/influence-and-legacy/enduring-wisdom/wisdom-for-living"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-eternal-dao","title":"永恒的道","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/influence-and-legacy/enduring-wisdom/the-eternal-dao"}]}]}